# OEX — Project Layout & Conventions

**Project:** OEX (Online Examination System)  
**Stack:** Vue.js · Node.js · PostgreSQL · Prisma  
**UI language:** English

## Repository map

```
OEX/
├── PrjMng/          # Progress & tasks — read first when resuming work
├── docs/            # Design & requirements (stable reference)
├── backend/         # Node.js REST API
├── frontend/        # Vue.js SPA
├── Ref/             # External references & templates (read-only)
├── .cursor/         # Cursor rules & skills (agent config)
├── docker-compose.yml
├── .env.example
├── .gitignore
└── README.md
```

## Folder purposes

| Folder | Purpose | Put here | Do NOT put here |
|--------|---------|----------|-----------------|
| `PrjMng/` | Implementation state & next steps | `STATUS.md`, `TASKS.md`, `DECISIONS.md`, `CHANGELOG.md` | Design specs, source code |
| `docs/` | Formal project documentation | Requirements, detailed design, API notes | Task checklists, secrets |
| `backend/` | API, Prisma, business logic | `src/`, `prisma/`, tests | Frontend code, `.env` |
| `frontend/` | Vue SPA | `src/`, public assets, FE tests | Backend code, API secrets |
| `Ref/` | Third-party / school templates | Reference skills, sample docs | Application runtime code |

## PrjMng/ — context recovery (critical)

Before implementing or continuing work, read **`PrjMng/STATUS.md`**.

| File | Role |
|------|------|
| `STATUS.md` | Current phase, done / in-progress / blocked, **next action** |
| `TASKS.md` | Backlog by phase; checkbox tasks |
| `DECISIONS.md` | Locked choices (stack, scope cuts) — do not re-debate |
| `CHANGELOG.md` | Dated log of what was implemented |

Update `STATUS.md` and `CHANGELOG.md` when a phase or major task completes.

## docs/ — naming

| Pattern | Example |
|---------|---------|
| Requirements | `docs/basic_requirement.md` |
| Detailed design | `docs/OEX_DetailedDesign_V1.md` |
| Future SRS / API export | `docs/OEX_SRS_V1.md`, `docs/api/openapi.yaml` |

Design docs are **versioned** (`_V1`, `_V2`). Do not overwrite; add new version file.

## backend/ layout

```
backend/
├── src/
│   ├── routes/
│   ├── controllers/
│   ├── services/
│   ├── middleware/
│   ├── validators/
│   └── index.ts
├── prisma/
│   ├── schema.prisma
│   ├── seed.ts           # required — full sample data for dev & tests
│   └── seed-data.ts      # stable IDs exported for tests
├── tests/                # required — integration + unit tests
├── package.json
└── .env.example
```

### Backend quality gate (mandatory)

Backend implementation is **not done** until:

1. `prisma/seed.ts` includes the minimum catalog in `oex-backend` skill (admin, teacher, students, subjects, questions, exams, assignments).
2. `npm run test` exits **0** with **0 failures** from `backend/`.
3. Tests run against a prepared test DB (`npm run db:test:prepare` or equivalent) — no manual data entry.

Follow `.cursor/skills/oex-backend/SKILL.md` and `project-context.md` for pass criteria and seed catalog.

## frontend/ layout

```
frontend/
├── src/
│   ├── api/
│   ├── components/
│   ├── views/
│   ├── router/
│   ├── stores/
│   └── types/
├── public/
└── package.json
```

## Root & environment

- **`docker-compose.yml`** — PostgreSQL for local dev (repo root only).
- **`.env.example`** — Template vars; never commit real `.env`.
- **Secrets** — `JWT_SECRET`, `DATABASE_URL` in `.env` (gitignored).

## Agent workflow

1. Read `PrjMng/STATUS.md` → know phase and next step.
2. Read relevant section in `docs/OEX_DetailedDesign_V1.md` before coding.
3. Code in `backend/` or `frontend/` only.
4. Update `PrjMng/TASKS.md`, `STATUS.md`, `CHANGELOG.md` after meaningful progress.

## Coding skills

| Location | Skills (apply together) |
|----------|-------------------------|
| `backend/`, `prisma/`, API tests | `oex-coding` + `oex-backend` |
| `frontend/`, FE tests | `oex-coding` + `frontend-design` |
| Both tiers in one task | All three skills as needed |

**Always:** this rule (`oex-project-layout.mdc`) is mandatory for every task.

| Skill | Path | Scope |
|-------|------|-------|
| Shared coding | `.cursor/skills/oex-coding/SKILL.md` | Discipline, workflow, scope — backend **and** frontend |
| Backend | `.cursor/skills/oex-backend/SKILL.md` | API, Prisma, services — **backend only** |
| Frontend | `.cursor/skills/frontend-design/SKILL.md` | UI, Vue, styling — **frontend only** |

## Out of scope for v1

No Excel import, no anti-cheat, no class module, single-answer MCQ only — see `docs/OEX_DetailedDesign_V1.md` §15.
